[00:00.00] 作词 : Roger Waters/Richard Wright
[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Roger Waters/Richard Wright
[00:35.48]Stay and help me to end the day.
[00:35.48]留下来吧 助我度过这一天
[00:43.07]And if you don't mind,
[00:43.07]要是你不介意
[00:47.62]We'll break a bottle of wine.
[00:47.62]我们可以碎酒瓶玩耍
[00:52.04]Stick around and maybe we'll put one down,
[00:52.04]四处溜达 可能我们会羞辱别人
[01:00.29]Because I wanna find what lies behind those eyes.
[01:00.29]因为我想找出那些目光背后的含义
[01:10.51]Midnight blue burning gold.
[01:10.51]午夜幽蓝如同燃烧的碎金
[01:18.84]A yellow moon is growing cold.
[01:18.84]一轮黄月愈觉冷艳
[01:43.02]I rise, looking through my morning eyes,
[01:43.02]我起床了 透过惺忪的睡眼
[01:51.41]Surprised to find you by my side.
[01:51.41]惊奇地发现你居然站在我这边
[01:59.61]Rack my brain to try to remember your name
[01:59.61]我绞尽脑汁回想你的名字
[02:08.22]To find the words to tell you good-bye.
[02:08.22]寒暄几句和你匆匆道别
[02:17.68]Morning dues.
[02:17.68]已是早晨啦
[02:18.77]
[02:21.80]Newborn day.
[02:21.80]又是崭新的一天
[02:25.76]Midnight blue turned to gray.
[02:25.76]午夜时的幽蓝已沦为灰白
[03:14.72]Midnight blue burning gold.
[03:14.72]午夜幽蓝如同燃烧的碎金
